<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Incorporeal</ansi> mutation

Your form has slipped between planes — flesh, bone, and sinew giving way to
something less tangible. Physical attacks struggle to find purchase against
your shifting form, but the same ethereality that protects you weakens your
constitution.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Transcendent

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Greatly improved physical defense — your ethereal form is difficult
  to strike
  Moderately increased willpower — touching the planes grants clarity

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Significantly reduced vitality — your less-tangible form is frail
  Worn armor and wielded weapons lose effectiveness — the deeper you
  drift from the physical world, the more insubstantial your gear
  becomes

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Extra Arms, Extra Legs, Clawed Hands, Tail, Dense Muscles,
Hollow Bones, Healing Gel

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
